/**
 * Generates the `aus-emergency-dispatcher-objects` MSFS package that ships with
 * the app and is auto-installed into the user's Community folder, so every
 * operator sees the same scene objects with no configuration.
 *
 * The models are ORIGINAL low-poly meshes assembled from coloured boxes — a
 * shared, consistent baseline that reads at a glance (a red sedan, a white
 * ambulance with a light bar, a hi-vis figure, a rescue boat) without any
 * third-party assets. Nothing here is downloaded or redistributed: everything
 * is generated by this script and is free for all users. See CREDITS.txt.
 *
 * A model is spawned at runtime with SimConnect `AICreateSimulatedObject`, which
 * only accepts *Dynamic* SimObjects — hence `category = SimpleObject` and a
 * WindsockAssistance base container. If a sim rejects one, the injector's title
 * chain (scenes.ts) falls back to the base-game `Windsock`.
 *
 * Run: `node resources/msfs-packages/_build.mjs`
 */
